<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Banish</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: none (no guild teaches it)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast banish &lt;creature&gt;
use a wand, staff or scroll of banish
</pre>
<p>The caster calls on the power of the vortex to take a summoned creature 
back: an elemental, a demon or a devil called up by a summoning spell 
twists in pain and dissolves. It is the answer to a conjurer's servants.
</p><p>It only works on creatures that were summoned by magic; on anything else, 
nothing happens. The creature resists, and if the spell fails, it turns on 
you. You must be standing. No guild teaches it, but it turns up on wands, 
staffs and scrolls among random treasure.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summon Earth</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summon Demon</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>